    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Cleopatra VII "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "克利奥帕特拉七世"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " was the last queen of ancient Egypt. She is one of the "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b1",
            "number": 1
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " rulers in history. For a very long time—almost 2,000 years—the "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b2",
            "number": 2
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of her tomb has been a great "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "mystery",
            "ref": "v-mystery"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". But now, some scientists think they might be "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b3",
            "number": 3
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " to solving it."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "A team of scientists has been working at an ancient temple in "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Alexandria",
            "zh": "亚历山大"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", a city in northern Egypt. While working there, they found "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b4",
            "number": 4
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " amazing: a long "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "tunnel",
            "ref": "v-tunnel"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " about 13 metres under the ground. This tunnel is very long, about 1.3 kilometres. Inside, the team has found more than 1,500 "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b5",
            "number": 5
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". These include many "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "statues",
            "ref": "v-statue"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", beautiful golden pieces, and a lot of coins. Importantly, many of these coins have the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "image",
            "ref": "v-image"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b6",
            "number": 6
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of Cleopatra VII on them."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Finding these coins with her name is a big "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b7",
            "number": 7
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". The scientists now believe that a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "royal",
            "ref": "v-royal"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " tomb might be "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b8",
            "number": 8
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " somewhere near this tunnel. They think this tomb could "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b9",
            "number": 9
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " Cleopatra VII. The team is very excited and will keep searching the area. Everyone is waiting to see if this is finally the discovery of the famous queen’s "
          },
          {
            "t": "blank",
            "id": "b10",
            "number": 10
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "resting place",
            "ref": "v-resting-place"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
